  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "text": "CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Ign 5 / B13 - low-side, NO internal flywheel diode - diode-suppressed relay fitted (TE 7-1904094-9)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 1: Switched 12V - INJECTOR power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 2: Switched 12V - COP / ignition coil power feed (size 12, 25A)\nsp_gndout-Splice 1: crossover (a): B leg of sensor Gnd Out from the splice at ECU A (B22 joins it) - splice drawn on ST185-A-cabin\nsp_5v-Splice 1: crossover (a): B leg of the +5V sensor supply from the splice at ECU A - splice drawn on ST185-A-cabin\nsp_chassis-Splice 1: ECU-B power grounds B25/B34 join the cabin chassis ground splice - splice drawn on ST185-A-cabin\nsp_sw12-Splice 1: switched 12V bus splice at ECU A feeding a B-side load - splice drawn on ST185-A-cabin",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 4200,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
